Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:48.96,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}梅德韦杰夫 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}7{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}5 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 卢布列夫 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was a great tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 这是一届很棒的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Fun, fun one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,很开心 很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Some good matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,也打了几场好球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:05.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Felt some good tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:05.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉自己打得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.52,EN,,0,0,0,,And today I served pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天发球也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:09.12,EN,,0,0,0,,So really happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,对此我很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.78,EN,,0,0,0,,And, yeah, happy, happy to get the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,能拿到冠军 真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:14.86,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's really something meaningful for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:14.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对你来说也很有意义
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.24,EN,,0,0,0,,to play against your compatriot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,和自己的同胞交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:19.38,EN,,0,0,0,,You had a previous experience
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:19.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,你此前也曾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:21.52,EN,,0,0,0,,of taking on him in a final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,在决赛里和他交过手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:22.86,EN,,0,0,0,,And you won that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:22.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且赢下了那场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:25.90,EN,,0,0,0,,And also you are the... you're the one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:25.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,这次你也再次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.30,EN,,0,0,0,,who stands in this final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,成为决赛的获胜者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:30.92,EN,,0,0,0,,So how does this final mean to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:30.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场决赛对你意味着什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:31.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:31.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 我想说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:32.62,EN,,0,0,0,,it's never easy to play
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:32.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,这从来都不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:33.54,EN,,0,0,0,,someone from your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:33.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,和自己的同胞比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:35.92,EN,,0,0,0,,There is always a tiny bit more on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,总会比平时更在意一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:37.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Even if, in the end, we don't care —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,虽然说到底 对手是谁并不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:38.84,EN,,0,0,0,,whoever you play in the final,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:38.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,决赛无论对谁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:39.46,EN,,0,0,0,,you want to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,你都想赢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:41.18,EN,,0,0,0,,But there's a tiny bit more on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:41.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,但和同胞交手 还是更在意一些
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:42.82,EN,,0,0,0,,So, for sure, a lot more nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:42.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以肯定会更紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:45.72,EN,,0,0,0,,And I think I handled it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:45.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己处理得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:47.38,EN,,0,0,0,,I played good in important moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,关键时刻 我打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:48.96,EN,,0,0,0,,And I'm really happy about my level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我对自己的表现很满意
